+## Review b468dd0695d7139e — key/termination interaction finding
+
+The lesson checker exercises each key and each termination type separately but does not require their interaction. In the retained ordinary seed-0 lesson, key 1 appears only on blocked rays while wall termination is shown by other keys. A protected-Racket rival that suppresses wall-terminated key-1 rays therefore matches all four demonstrations; the existing `lesson_identifiable` check returns no finding, yet the rival changes a lawful generated query by one cell.
+
+Production is unchanged. Retained evidence is under `counterexamples/review-b468dd0695d7139e/`. Next action: require coverage of key × termination pairs, or add executable key-specific termination rivals to lesson admission.
+
